(1. Core Intake Tracking & App Sync: A capacitive sensor strip integrated into the) Tj
T* (bottle's wall measures water volume changes in real-time. This data is synced via) Tj
T* (Bluetooth Low Energy \(BLE\) to a companion mobile app, providing users with a) Tj
T* (fundamental log of their daily water consumption and progress visualization.) Tj
