(2. Dynamic Hydration Goal Engine: The mobile app calculates a personalized daily) Tj
T* (hydration goal by integrating with Apple HealthKit or Google Fit to pull user biometrics) Tj
T* (and activity levels. The goal dynamically adjusts throughout the day based on) Tj
T* (completed workouts and local weather data fetched from a public API.) Tj
